## Limits

- All four families were fixed before their tests; no test-driven model or structure selection or new promotion.
- Five fixed random seeds on the official split, not five-fold cross validation.
- Sample standard deviations use ddof=1; same-seed differences are descriptive, not a significance test.
- Training nodes and scheduling differ: seeds0/1/3 on P4, seed2 on RTX4060Ti; full-null on the recovery RTX4060Ti, with seed128 from concurrent recovery and seeds0..3 serial. Matching seed labels does not establish identical trajectories or node equivalence.
- Encoded training AV permutation retains alignment cues and natural evaluation. These outcomes do not establish raw-input causality, shared semantics, novelty or SOTA.
- Lease final dynamic preservation remains pending; all sources, failures, partials and copies retained.
